---
description: Archivist documentation discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses the Archivist docs system (docs tree: docs/). After
changing code, before finishing: map each change to its doc home (module
docs 04-modules/, ADRs 05-decisions/, changelog 07-meta/changelog.md) per
docs/07-meta/documentation-guide.md and update those docs — or state
explicitly: 'No docs needed because <reason>'.
